    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Breadcrumb helps users understand where they are and move back through parent levels. It supports icons, custom separators, route context, URI navigation, and item templates.</source>
        <target state="translated">Breadcrumb 幫助用戶理解當前位置，並沿父級路徑返回。它支持圖標、自定義分隔符、路由上下文、URI 導航和條目模板。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Show the current page location in a navigation hierarchy.</source>
        <target state="translated">展示當前頁面在導航層級中的位置。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
