    <unit id="SemanticPartItemDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Item element with text color, link color transitions, hover effects, padding, border-radius, height, and margin styles</source>
        <target state="translated">Item 元素，包含文字顏色、連結的顏色變化、懸浮效果、內邊距、圓角、高度、外邊距等樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartRootDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Root element with text color, font size, icon size and other basic styles, using flex layout with ordered list</source>
        <target state="translated">根元素，包含文字顏色、字體大小、圖示尺寸等基礎樣式，內部使用 flex 佈局的有序列表</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartSeparatorDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Separator element with margin and color styles for the divider</source>
        <target state="translated">分隔符元素，包含分隔符的外邊距和顏色樣式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Mirrors the Ant Design style-class demo: customize the root border, item color and separator color through generated Semantic Part styles.</source>
        <target state="translated">對齊 Ant Design 的 style-class demo：透過生成的 Semantic Part 樣式自訂根邊框、項目顏色與分隔符顏色。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
